{"title":"별과 별 사이","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=wGiCp/hAFrLmwBb5/aPgJMGqWK6zGWphaH3r3lk&filename=th3","synopsis":"하나뿐인 형이 사고로 다쳤다.\n\n범인은 부잣집 아들에 준수한 외모로 학교의 유명 인사이자\n주인공 ‘윤별’과 동급생인 ‘성운’.\n\n아무리 후한 보상금을 줬다 해도,\n유일한 가족인 형이 다쳤는데 가만있을 수 없다고 생각했지만…\n\n“내가 찾아서 그 새끼 죽일 거야!!”\n“별아, 그러지 마. 다들 조용히 끝내고 싶어 해. 학교도 마찬가지고, 나도…”\n\n형은 이를 덮으려 하는 것만 같다.\n\n그리고 편의점 알바에, 조용한 성격까지\n‘성운’은 알려진 이미지와는 전혀 다른 모습이었다.\n\n그럼 우리 형은 왜 밀었던 거야?\n------------------------\n*매주 화요일 22시에 연재됩니다*","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":178,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":185,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":124,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":169,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":149,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":256,"change":{"type":"down","amount":107}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":179,"change":{"type":"up","amount":77}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":247,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":211,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":188,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":170,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":250,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":190,"change":{"type":"up","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-